    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/a0f062cb8fe50ecca686574aea31a591.avif?t=1752453482\" width=600 height=195 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/fd7fa975f72f41f020a2ae15b59b3264.avif?t=1752453482\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a skin for your Stickman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a picture that you can place anywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the colors of all the weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And More!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/5142aea78ae79aed63281fcadb70533b.poster.avif?t=1752453482\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/5142aea78ae79aed63281fcadb70533b.webm?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/5142aea78ae79aed63281fcadb70533b.mp4?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/90a9df76901f3ae2b4a4f7294233a943.avif?t=1752453482\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a variety of weapons, grenades, and abilities to defeat the Erasers and reign victorious in PvE! Also, try out PvEvP, where you can fight against The Erasers along with fighting your StickFriends to try and get the highest score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/392c0a627e684986666d3171360c8687.poster.avif?t=1752453482\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/392c0a627e684986666d3171360c8687.webm?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/392c0a627e684986666d3171360c8687.mp4?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/37f77a4a486e5ec569a78ea3b2fd80da.avif?t=1752453482\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with many PvE levels, there's a variety of PvP options. Fight against your Stickfriends and Stick it to 'em!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/f45862d1113dcf904dce074d7fa2b0f2.poster.avif?t=1752453482\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/f45862d1113dcf904dce074d7fa2b0f2.webm?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/f45862d1113dcf904dce074d7fa2b0f2.mp4?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/a5eb75ba44af53c01f4bf8bd8b7e69f8.avif?t=1752453482\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a fun-to-use movement system with Double Jumps, sliding, wall running, and a grappling hook, on top of changing level mechanics that can variate the movement!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/7d9d3c8738abdda09705366ef7165137.poster.avif?t=1752453482\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/7d9d3c8738abdda09705366ef7165137.webm?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/7d9d3c8738abdda09705366ef7165137.mp4?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/0aa0995da2f2781960cff9fe192ca83e.avif?t=1752453482\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build levels with a built-in level editor! Then you can share those levels with friends and battle it out in PvP!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/0fbbf08f7ec019c4bd30ddc38431aead.poster.avif?t=1752453482\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/0fbbf08f7ec019c4bd30ddc38431aead.webm?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/0fbbf08f7ec019c4bd30ddc38431aead.mp4?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/07cce892da439b24c3b7296f7ac87849.avif?t=1752453482\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly, have fun! Because that's why we play video games in the first place.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/fd7fa975f72f41f020a2ae15b59b3264.avif?t=1752453482\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a skin for your Stickman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a picture that you can place anywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the colors of all the weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And More!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/5142aea78ae79aed63281fcadb70533b.poster.avif?t=1752453482\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/5142aea78ae79aed63281fcadb70533b.webm?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/5142aea78ae79aed63281fcadb70533b.mp4?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/90a9df76901f3ae2b4a4f7294233a943.avif?t=1752453482\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a variety of weapons, grenades, and abilities to defeat the Erasers and reign victorious in PvE! Also, try out PvEvP, where you can fight against The Erasers along with fighting your StickFriends to try and get the highest score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/392c0a627e684986666d3171360c8687.poster.avif?t=1752453482\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/392c0a627e684986666d3171360c8687.webm?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/392c0a627e684986666d3171360c8687.mp4?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/37f77a4a486e5ec569a78ea3b2fd80da.avif?t=1752453482\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with many PvE levels, there's a variety of PvP options. Fight against your Stickfriends and Stick it to 'em!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/f45862d1113dcf904dce074d7fa2b0f2.poster.avif?t=1752453482\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/f45862d1113dcf904dce074d7fa2b0f2.webm?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/f45862d1113dcf904dce074d7fa2b0f2.mp4?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/a5eb75ba44af53c01f4bf8bd8b7e69f8.avif?t=1752453482\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a fun-to-use movement system with Double Jumps, sliding, wall running, and a grappling hook, on top of changing level mechanics that can variate the movement!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/7d9d3c8738abdda09705366ef7165137.poster.avif?t=1752453482\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/7d9d3c8738abdda09705366ef7165137.webm?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/7d9d3c8738abdda09705366ef7165137.mp4?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/0aa0995da2f2781960cff9fe192ca83e.avif?t=1752453482\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build levels with a built-in level editor! Then you can share those levels with friends and battle it out in PvP!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/0fbbf08f7ec019c4bd30ddc38431aead.poster.avif?t=1752453482\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/0fbbf08f7ec019c4bd30ddc38431aead.webm?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/0fbbf08f7ec019c4bd30ddc38431aead.mp4?t=1752453482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/07cce892da439b24c3b7296f7ac87849.avif?t=1752453482\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly, have fun! Because that's why we play video games in the first place.</p>",
